    }

    private function verwalterserviceSectionOne(): string
    {
        return 'Would you like to focus on owners, strategy and growth – without getting lost in day-to-day business? We support small property management companies, sole traders and private individuals who manage their own building, wherever operational tasks cost time, resources and nerves. With clear processes, clean documentation and a team that knows what matters. We take over operational services for your properties and make sure that processes remain structured, transparent and efficient. Our support includes: office management, property accounting, dunning & debt collection, property inspections & condition checks, damage documentation & insurance handling, renovation support and energy performance certificates.';
    }

    private function hausverwaltungAnswer(): string
    {
        return '<p>To find the right property management company, look for experience, transparent cost structures and knowledge of the regional market. Compare several providers, ask for references and check whether the company offers digital solutions for communication and billing. A good property management company stands out through quick availability, transparent contracts and sustainable building management – this is how you protect the long-term value of your property.</p>';
